	(text "Charlieplexed button reading procedure:\n1. Set all pin to ANALOG in, except for one row to output HIGH\n2. Wait until the pin state settles\n3. Read all ANALOG pin for button detection\n4. Repeat for all rows\nKnown issue:\nPressing Esc would cause CDEF to be read as released.\nThis is required for entering USB bootloader.\nDebouncing/disabling mechanism can mitigate that.\nReason to use red LED:\nAnti-ghosting measurement.\nIt has optimal voltage drop of ~1.7V,\neasy to tell 1 vs 2 red LED being passed thru."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.186 94.742 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "15f6329e-7f2d-4fcb-9723-1c6818fef46c")
	)
	(text "SOIC-8-150mil\nAlternative:\nW25X40CLSNIG"
